{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Purrrifiers: Cleaning Chaos</strong></u> blends chaos, absurd humor, and real co-op gameplay, defining its own quirky genre - the \u201cGoofylike\u201d. It\u2019s a messy, magical, cat-filled adventure where teamwork, creativity, and a bit of madness are required to survive (and clean). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf9<strong>Clean, Cast, and Cause Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/ce4cfaa7c7e6327f528e58c7a8b5a863.poster.avif?t=1772062408\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/ce4cfaa7c7e6327f528e58c7a8b5a863.webm?t=1772062408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/ce4cfaa7c7e6327f528e58c7a8b5a863.mp4?t=1772062408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Half cleaning sim, half fever dream, Purrrifiers: Cleaning Chaos drops players into a world where mops meet magic and every mess hides a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>Police Station</strong>, <strong>Streamer House, Wizard\u2019s Home, Underground Tunnels</strong>, the <strong>Burnt Dragon Battlefield</strong>, and even a <strong>forest ruled by a very polite deer</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? <strong>Make it shine.</strong> Or at least make it less disgusting. Along the way, you\u2019ll fight <strong>Toiletmort</strong>, <strong>purge computers of digital curses, do laundry, and pet an unreasonable number of cats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfd<strong>Tools of (Un)Sanity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/929d0ab7efc30d5deb89ac49566c3193.poster.avif?t=1772062408\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/929d0ab7efc30d5deb89ac49566c3193.webm?t=1772062408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/929d0ab7efc30d5deb89ac49566c3193.mp4?t=1772062408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can switch between absurdly satisfying cleaning gadgets, including:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure washer, vacuum, sponge, spray, and a magic wand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color-coded trash bins (for those who still believe in order)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plunger-on-a-rope, a chip bag for collecting chips, and the legendary Poop Stick\u2122</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting and melting stations to upgrade your cleaning empire</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Trashyard Sandbox</strong>, players can wash procedurally generated junk, earn resources, and build the ultimate recycling fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfc<strong>It\u2019s More Than Soap and Water</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/d4811539c7cd98bde11a62625269b93a.poster.avif?t=1772062408\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/d4811539c7cd98bde11a62625269b93a.webm?t=1772062408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/d4811539c7cd98bde11a62625269b93a.mp4?t=1772062408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open world</strong> packed with story missions, secrets, and garbage,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talking cats</strong> that hand out quests (and occasionally life advice),</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Buffs and debuffs</strong> like cringe damage, electric shocks, and healing kisses,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic meets mess</strong> \u2014 clean with wands, defeat bosses, solve weird puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op or solo play</strong> \u2014 teamwork makes the dream clean</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc08<strong>A Chaotic Co-Op Comedy About Cleaning (and Cats)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/867a155cf5d392e71f2b7e0c6091b604.poster.avif?t=1772062408\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/867a155cf5d392e71f2b7e0c6091b604.webm?t=1772062408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/867a155cf5d392e71f2b7e0c6091b604.mp4?t=1772062408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purrrifiers: Cleaning Chaos isn\u2019t about perfection \u2014 it\u2019s about <strong>embracing the chaos, laughing at the mess, and celebrating every half-clean corner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s <strong>Goofylike</strong>, it\u2019s absurd, and it\u2019s waiting for you. Grab a friend, pet a cat, and get your wand ready. Because in this world, cleanliness might be next to catliness \u2014 but chaos is never far behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/228eefa591d77619ad3f967546782eab.avif?t=1772062408\" width=614 height=114 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finish tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2117430/383f7d35c8fe533608e4fbd76291b148754f1930.jpg"},{"name":"Finish first Mayor quest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2117430/907ead6d044fa48da6fa23a7717ff110dded6738.jpg"},{"name":"Pickup first cleaning tool","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2117430/4f0251684111302c65bd70d4c6e635b3ce2eb54e.jpg"},{"name":"Heal your friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2117430/70def0c773c41fd84cbb1a633f0f9640dc045d22.jpg"},{"name":"Make a poop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2117430/f73fbf62c9694de9db0c32d02ff2e09c7a5ad944.jpg"},{"name":"Use the toilet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2117430/5be1f799557db2dffbe6c5aebccba08556b417d3.jpg"},{"name":"Finish first Mrrvirry quest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2117430/8a16f847c4df95a0af724afa8d75593335ced6a8.jpg"},{"name":"Find gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2117430/863200d14c82431da43d9fc8db1838a369a40d93.jpg"},{"name":"Disco party","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2117430/770420fbb0ebc9d1bb0b07752c4741e5e68a22db.jpg"},{"name":"Yes Sir!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2117430/142fca48fa88794402e4acffa4c92378b6a79718.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2117430?t=1772062408","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772062408","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/3b1a42e7cb91076a645cab1d989940a35d757594/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772062408","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/3b1a42e7cb91076a645cab1d989940a35d757594/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772062408","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2235870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Purrrifiers: Cleaning Chaos</strong></u> blends chaos, absurd humor, and real co-op gameplay, defining its own quirky genre - the \u201cGoofylike\u201d. It\u2019s a messy, magical, cat-filled adventure where teamwork, creativity, and a bit of madness are required to survive (and clean). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf9<strong>Clean, Cast, and Cause Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/ce4cfaa7c7e6327f528e58c7a8b5a863.poster.avif?t=1772062408\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://s