bb_paragraph\" >Pressure washer, vacuum, sponge, spray, and a magic wand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color-coded trash bins (for those who still believe in order)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plunger-on-a-rope, a chip bag for collecting chips, and the legendary Poop Stick\u2122</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting and melting stations to upgrade your cleaning empire</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Trashyard Sandbox</strong>, players can wash procedurally generated junk, earn resources, and build the ultimate recycling fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfc<strong>It\u2019s More Than Soap and Water</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/d4811539c7cd98bde11a62625269b93a.poster.avif?t=1772062408\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/d4811539c7cd98bde11a62625269b93a.webm?t=1772062408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/d4811539c7cd98bde11a62625269b93a.mp4?t=1772062408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open world</strong> packed with story missions, secrets, and garbage,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talking cats</strong> that hand out quests (and occasionally life advice),</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Buffs and debuffs</strong> like cringe damage, electric shocks, and healing kisses,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic meets mess</strong> \u2014 clean with wands, defeat bosses, solve weird puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op or solo play</strong> \u2014 teamwork makes the dream clean</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc08<strong>A Chaotic Co-Op Comedy About Cleaning (and Cats)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/867a155cf5d392e71f2b7e0c6091b604.poster.avif?t=1772062408\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/867a155cf5d392e71f2b7e0c6091b604.webm?t=1772062408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/867a155cf5d392e71f2b7e0c6091b604.mp4?t=1772062408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purrrifiers: Cleaning Chaos isn\u2019t about perfection \u2014 it\u2019s about <strong>embracing the chaos, laughing at the mess, and celebrating every half-clean corner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s <strong>Goofylike</strong>, it\u2019s absurd, and it\u2019s waiting for you. Grab a friend, pet a cat, and get your wand ready. Because in this world, cleanliness might be next to catliness \u2014 but chaos is never far behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/228eefa591d77619ad3f967546782eab.avif?t=1772062408\" width=614 height=114 /></span></p>","developers":["Rubens Games","FreeMind S.A."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/header.jpg?t=177206